{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團Big Bang襲港，今晚於啟德舉行演唱會，吸引全城粉絲到現場朝聖，當中更不乏圈中人，其中視后龔嘉欣與好友譚凱琪結伴睇騷，一同以皮褸配短裙上陣，型格現身。與此同時，歌手吳業坤則與日籍太太濱口愛子拍拖入場，兩人以黑色情侶裝示人，吳業坤更舉起V字手勢，表現興奮。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.329352+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:35:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:13.847534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:02.359227+00:00","content_hash":"00af03b56539503bff342522488acaed3bd180ae6de61325f6315af8bec8f9e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.329352+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}